re not available yet were mailed on October 26, 2016.  The recall began on August 15, 2017.  Owners may contact Chrysler customer service at 1-800-853-1403.  Chrysler's number for this recall is S61.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":1435625,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=16V668000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":23,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2010","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"SEBRING"},{"year":"2010","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2010","make":"DODGE","model":"CALIBER"},{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"COMPASS"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"},{"year":"2012","make":"JEEP","model":"PATRIOT"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"},{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"PATRIOT"},{"year":"2013","make":"JEEP","model":"PATRIOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"JEEP","model":"COMPASS"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"CALIBER"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"CALIBER"},{"year":"2012","make":"JEEP","model":"COMPASS"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"},{"year":"2013","make":"JEEP","model":"COMPASS"},{"year":"2013","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2014","make":"JEEP","model":"PATRIOT"},{"year":"2010","make":"JEEP","model":"PATRIOT"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2014","make":"JEEP","model":"COMPASS"},{"year":"2014","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2014","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"11V315000","received":"2011-06-08","manufacturer":"CHRYSLER GROUP LLC","component":"STEERING:COLUMN","summary":"CHRYSLER IS RECALLING CERTAIN MODEL YEAR 2011DODGE JOURNEY, JEEP WRANGLER, CHRYSLER 200, CHRYSLER 200 CONVERTIBLE, DODGE AVENGER, DODGE NITRO, JEEP LIBERTY, DODGE CALIBER, JEEP COMPASS, JEEP PATRIOT, DODGE GRAND CARAVAN AND CHRYSLER TOWN & COUNTRY VEHICLES.  SOME OF THESE VEHICLES MAY HAVE BEEN BUILT WITH A MISSING OR INCORRECTLY INSTALLED STEERING COLUMN PIVOT RIVET.","consequence":"A MISSING OR INCORRECTLY INSTALLED RIVET COULD COMPROMISE THE ABILITY OF THE STEERING COLUMN TO SUPPORT THE OCCUPANT LOADS IN THE EVENT OF A FRONTAL CRASH, DECREASING THE EFFECTIVENESS OF THE FRONTAL IMPACT SAFETY SYSTEM.  AS A RESULT, THE CONDITION MAY INCREASE THE POTENTIAL FOR INJURY IN A FRONTAL CRASH.","remedy":"DEALERS WILL INSPECT FOR RIVET PRESENCE AND ALIGNMENT AND REPAIR THE STEERING COLUMN PIVOT AS REQUIRED, FREE OF CHARGE.  THE SAFETY RECALL BEGAN ON JULY 4, 2011.  OWNERS MAY CONTACT CHRYSLER AT 1-800-853-1403.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":11096,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=11V315000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":12,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"LIBERTY"},{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"COMPASS"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"NITRO"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200 CONVERTIBLE"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"JOURNEY"},{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"WRANGLER"},{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"PATRIOT"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"TOWN AND COUNTRY"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"CALIBER"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"GRAND CARAVAN"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false},{"campaign":"13V282000","received":"2013-07-02","manufacturer":"Chrysler Group LLC","component":"ELECTRICAL SYSTEM","summary":"Chrysler is recalling certain model year 2011-2013 Sebring and 200 vehicles manufactured June 28, 2011, through December 13, 2012; model year 2011-2013 Dodge Avenger vehicles manufactured June 25, 2011, through January 14, 2013; model year 2011-2012 Dodge Nitro vehicles manufactured June 17, 2011, through December 15, 2011; and model year 2011-2012 Jeep Liberty vehicles manufactured June 17, 2011, through August 15, 2012.  Electrical over-stress of a resistor in the occupant restraint control module may lead to the non-deployment of the active head restraints during a rear impact collision.","consequence":"In the event of a crash necessitating the deployment of the active head restraints , their non-deployment could increase the risk of injury.","remedy":"Chrysler will notify owners, and dealers will flash the Totally Integrated Power Module (TIPM) or replace the occupant restraint control module, as needed, free of charge.  The recall began on November 19, 2013.  Owners may contact Chrysler at 1-800-247-9753.  Chrysler's recall campaign number is N38.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":442320,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=13V282000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":13,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2011","make":"JEEP","model":"LIBERTY"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2011","make":"DODGE","model":"NITRO"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"},{"year":"2012","make":"JEEP","model":"LIBERTY"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"200"},{"year":"2013","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"AVENGER"},{"year":"2012","make":"DODGE","model":"NITRO"},{"year":"2011","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"SEBRING"},{"year":"2012","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"SEBRING"},{"year":"2013","make":"CHRYSLER","model":"SEBRING"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false}]}
